# Model weights (large; live under models/ which is already ignored)
*.pt
# EXCEPT the committed landing-pad model. landing_real.json ships detector
# backend "ultralytics" + weights "models/pad_v1.pt", so the scored Challenge-2A
# landing works on a bare checkout with NO --weights flag / separate-channel
# fetch. This negation must stay AFTER both `models/*.pt` and `*.pt` (last match
# wins). Regenerate via pipeline.py if retrained; the path/name is the contract.
!models/pad_v1.pt
